l one\"},{\"text\":\"E2 and E4 are escalated differently.\",\"line\":6,\"span\":\"they are\\nescalated differently\"},{\"text\":\"To clear E2 in the field, free the pin with the service key.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"Free the pin with the service key\"},{\"text\":\"To clear E2 in the field, cycle the dock twice.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"cycle the dock twice\"},{\"text\":\"If the dock takes a bike and releases it on both cycles, close the fault on the handheld.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"If the dock takes a\\nbike and releases it on both cycles, close the fault on your handheld.\"},{\"text\":\"E2 is escalated to the workshop after 2 failed attempts.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"Escalate E2 to the workshop after 2 failed attempts.\"},{\"text\":\"Field crew should not keep cycling a dock that has failed twice.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"Do not keep cycling a dock\\nthat has failed twice\"},{\"text\":\"Repeated forcing bends the pin.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"repeated forcing bends the pin\"},{\"text\":\"Repeated forcing turns a 20 minute workshop job into a replacement.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"turns a 20 minute\\nworkshop job into a replacement\"},{\"text\":\"E4 is never a field fix.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"E4 is never a field fix\"},{\"text\":\"E4 is reported to the electrical contractor the same day.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"Report E4 to the electrical contractor the same day.\"},{\"text\":\"Field crew do not open the power enclosure under any circumstances.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"Field crew do not open the\\npower enclosure under any circumstances.\"},{\"text\":\"A station with more than half its docks faulted is taken out of service in the app.\",\"line\":27,\"span\":\"A station with more than half its docks faulted is taken out of service in the\\napp.\"},{\"text\":\"The support desk must be told before a station is taken out of service, not after.\",\"line\":28,\"span\":\"Tell the support desk before you do this, not after.\"}]}","ttft_ms":7349,"type":"result","duration_ms":7388,"uuid":"9c20e2af-790c-4875-9302-7e50022b99fc","ttft_stream_ms":1612,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":1613,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
